{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52746","headline":"丹元子步天歌 南方七宿 七 · 王希明","name":"丹元子步天歌 南方七宿 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轸，四星似张翼相近，中央一个长沙子。\n左辖附两星，军门两黄近翼是。\n门下四个主司空，门东七乌青丘子。\n青丘之下名器府，器府之星三十二。\n以上便爲太微宫，黄道向上看取是。\n（以上二十八首均录自郑樵《通志》卷三八《天文略》第一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王希明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}